    {
      "id": "s09qf3mc5RNmH064TTdRv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1809.4069849650068,
      "y": 1221.4334246317549,
      "width": 632.519775390625,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0b",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 916822024,
      "version": 460,
      "versionNonce": 1153422456,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790004595322,
      "created": 1790004351214,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "远程仓库是否存在当前分支？\n不存在当前分支则创建当前分支\n如果说存在当前分支则push代码\n\n保护分支不得被推送\n比如 main 分支被保护，设置了 allow_direct_push = false。即使你是\nOwner，也绝对禁止直接 Push。必须走 Pull Request。\n\n强制推送检验：\n当前代码是否被允许强制推送\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "q3obwzTqe1QHRac9BJuLK",
      "originalText": "远程仓库是否存在当前分支？\n不存在当前分支则创建当前分支\n如果说存在当前分支则push代码\n\n保护分支不得被推送\n比如 main 分支被保护，设置了 allow_direct_push = false。即使你是 Owner，也绝对禁止直接 Push。必须走 Pull Request。\n\n强制推送检验：\n当前代码是否被允许强制推送\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
